<title>USA: LSB Bancshares completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>LSB Bancshares completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, N.C. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>LSB Bancshares Inc said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of Old North State Bank, based in Winston-Salem, North Carolina.</p>
<p>Old North State Bank shareholders to will get 0.938 share of LSB Bancshares for each share of Old North State Bank common stock. The total value of the LSB shares is about $31.2 million, or $19.70 per Old North State Bank share, based on LSB Bancshares recent trading price of $21 per share.</p>
<p>LSB now has assets of about $600 million, the company said in news release. LSB will now have 21 offices in Davidson, Forsyth and Stokes Counties in North Carolina.</p>
